# Marten project guide for coding agents

This is a Marten web application. The guide index is at <https://martenframework.com/docs/llms.txt>.

## Layout

- `config/settings/` — settings, including `installed_apps`
- `config/routes.cr` — routes
- `src/models/` — models
- `src/handlers/` — handlers
- `src/schemas/` — schemas
- `src/emails/` — emails
- `src/templates/` — templates
- `src/migrations/` — migrations
- `src/project.cr` — requires project code (`./models/**`, `./handlers/**`, `./schemas/**`, `./emails/**`)
- `src/cli.cr` — requires migrations (`./migrations/**`)
- `spec/` — specs

## Commands

Prefer generators. Run `marten gen <name> --help` for options.

```bash
marten gen model Article title:string{128} author:many_to_one{User}
marten gen handler ArticleListHandler
marten gen schema ArticleSchema title:string body:string
marten gen email WelcomeEmail
marten gen app blog
marten genmigrations
marten migrate
crystal spec
marten serve
```

`marten gen app` adds the application to `installed_apps` and requires it from `src/project.cr` and `src/cli.cr`. An application added by hand needs those same edits.

## Specs

`spec/spec_helper.cr` sets `MARTEN_ENV=test` and requires `marten/spec`. Spec files require that helper.

